          en: 'In the rematch with [[kastro|Kastro]], who lost to him two years ago, Hisoka loses both arms to Kastro and his Double, a copy of himself made of Nen. Then he picks out the real Kastro at once and kills him with a volley of cards. Later a woman sews his arms back on for a fee. Hisoka hides the seams with Bungee Gum, which makes his aura stretch and stick like gum, and Texture Surprise, which copies the look of skin. After his shower Hisoka peels the numbered spider tattoo off his back, a fake: now that he has found new toys in [[gon-freecss|Gon]] and [[killua|Killua]], it is time to hunt the Spiders of the Phantom Troupe.',
