          en: 'On the airship Killua tells [[gon-freecss|Gon]] that his parents are assassins and that he was raised to be one too. To leave home he had to attack his mother and his brother. When [[netero|Netero]] challenges them to take a ball from him, Killua uses an assassin’s attack and hits the old man’s leg, but hurts himself. He quits, irritated, runs into two applicants who demand an apology and kills them on the spot, thinking he might have killed Netero too to get the ball.',
