          en: 'In the last match of the Third Phase Killua faces [[johness|Johness]], a convict the others shy away from and whom [[leorio-paradinight|Leorio]] recognizes with alarm. Johness says he only wants to kill him, and Killua answers that the loser dies. Before the other man can move he rips out his heart, and Johness is dead in seconds. The team leads three to two, and a path opens.',
